# build-core is the canonical current project build. Plain `idf.py build` writes build/.
# Historical batch/Alpha/RC trees (build-a3-*, build-a4-*, build-batch*) stay ignored too,
# but a release tree (build-a3-rc1-post, build-a4-rc5) can hold artifacts that matter:
# ignored != safe to delete. Cleanup policy lives in native/tools/cleanup_builds.py.
/build/
/build-*/
/build-core/
